  <History Date="26-03-25" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (poor documentation.  contains range conflicts.  no pixel layout)" Version="0" />
  <History Date="27-03-25" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Delight Hydro Wash A-760 (identical except documentation includes a pixel layout.  charts are exactly the same visually)" Version="1" />
  <History Date="26-06-26" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Updated in line with latest documentation (adds 28 channel mode.  very confusing charts)" Version="3" />
  <History Date="17-07-26" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID for 28 channel mode." Version="5" />
  <History Date="07-08-26" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from LightSky AQUAPEARL-MINI (effectively identical except for no colour crossfade in 21 channel mode and reserved controls in 35 channel mode)" Version="6" />
